<title>USA: Omaha hogs off $1.00 - USDA.</title>
<headline>Omaha hogs off $1.00 - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>OMAHA 1997-02-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA said barrows and gilts were $1.00 lower. Top $50.50 per cwt.</p>
<p>    US 1-3    230-260 lbs mainly 50.50</p>
<p>    US 2-3    260-280 lbs    49.50-50.00</p>
<p>Sows - steady/up $2.00. Top $54.00.</p>
<p>    US 1-3    350-450 lbs    43.00-44.00</p>
<p>		  450-500 lbs    48.00</p>
</text>
